/episodes/3784600/where-the-mask-ends-1x19-episode-19","name":"Episode 19","season":1,"number":19,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-10-26","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-10-26T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":null,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784600"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/88082","name":"Where the Mask Ends"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":88082,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/88082/where-the-mask-ends","name":"Where the Mask Ends","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Romance"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":52,"premiered":"2026-10-16","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjU3MzkyOTA0NA==.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":85,"network":{"id":297,"name":"CCTV-8","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":{"id":118,"name":"Youku","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/645/1613260.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/645/1613260.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Chou was once a lowly night-soil collector, bullied and mistreated by everyone around her. But her striking resemblance to Wei Rao, the daughter of a marquis, unexpectedly makes her the bride of Lu Zhuo, the heir to a duke's household, in a marriage arranged to bring him good fortune and save his life. Ambitious and determined to rise above her station, Chou sees the marriage as her chance to climb the social ladder. However, her critically ill husband suddenly awakens, and her assumption of another woman's place brings one disaster after another. Furious that Chou has taken her place, Wei Rao is desperate to get rid of her. Meanwhile, Lu Zhuo regards Chou as a vicious and scheming woman, constantly guarding against her and plotting against her. Beneath the seemingly harmonious facade of the duke's household lie countless traps and deadly schemes. Caught in the midst of these hidden conflicts, Chou struggles to navigate the competing interests around her while carefully planning her future. Determined to break free from the shackles of fate, she eventually uncovers the secrets of her own origins and reunites with her loved ones. Rising from a humble night-soil collector to a woman of status, she transforms her life and creates a brilliant future for herself.</p>","updated":1792959222,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/88082"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784599","name":"Episode 18"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784600","name":"Episode 19"}}}}},{"id":3695051,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3695051/the-eternal-supreme-li-yunxiao-1x17-episode-17","name":"Episode 17","season":1,"number":17,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-10-26","airtime":"","airstamp":"2026-10-26T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":null,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3695051"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/93482","name":"The Eternal Supreme, Li Yunxiao"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":93482,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/93482/the-eternal-supreme-li-yunxiao","name":"The Eternal Supreme, Li Yunxiao","type":"Animation","language":"Chinese","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":null,"premiered":"2026-07-20","ended":null,"officialSite":null,"schedule":{"time":"","days":[]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":39,"network":null,"webChannel":{"id":51,"name":"Bilibili","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":480643,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/635/1589927.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/635/1589927.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Once hailed as the third-strongest expert on the Tianwu Continent, Martial Emperor Gu Feiyang found his cultivation trapped at its peak by the very laws of the world. To break through his limits, he orchestrated an audacious plan, sacrificing everything to reincarnate and begin anew. Reborn as Li Yunxiao, a fifteen-year-old heir of a powerful military family in the Kingdom of Tianshui, he finds himself caught in a storm of invasion, royal succession struggles, and political intrigue. While others fight for power and status, Li Yunxiao sees the bigger picture. Armed with the wisdom and experience of a former Martial Emperor, he calmly overcomes every obstacle on his path toward a single goal: completing the grand design he began in his previous life and laying the foundation for true godhood.</p>","updated":1786230313,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/93482"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3695043","name":"Episode 16"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3695051","name":"Episode 17"}}}}},{"id":3794815,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3794815/my-loong-1x13-episode-13","name":"Episode 13","season":1,"number":13,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-10-26","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-10-26T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":16,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3794815"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/94634","name":"My Loong"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":94634,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/94634/my-loong","name":"My Loong","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Fantasy","Romance"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageR